The watermark marks embedded in page/icons.js (logo-codex, logo-deepseek,
logo-claude, logo-kilo, logo-grok, logo-vscode) are the agents' own official
icons, the same files magpie draws beside an agent's name. Each is an
unmodified shape, filled with the slip's pale grey instead of its brand
colours:

- Codex: magpie's assets/icons/codex-color.svg (OpenAI's mark, its white tile
  dropped so the watermark is the mark alone)
- DeepSeek Harness: magpie's assets/icons/deepseek-color.svg
- Claude Code: magpie's assets/icons/claudecode-color.svg
- Kilo Code: magpie's assets/icons/kilocode.svg
